---
const highlights = [
  { label: 'On-grid range', value: '1.5–320 kW' },
  { label: 'Hybrid range', value: '3–12 kW' },
  { label: 'Peak efficiency', value: 'Up to 99.02%' },
  { label: 'Enclosure', value: 'IP66' },
];
---

<!-- overflow-x-clip, not overflow-hidden: `hidden` makes this a scroll container
     and breaks the sticky image column below. `clip` still contains the blurred
     glow horizontally without that side effect. -->
<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 bg-white overflow-x-clip" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container-main">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <!-- Right: Content -->
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-2">
        <span class="section-label">
          <span class="w-8 h-px bg-brand-500"></span>
          About Us
        </span>

        <h2 id="about-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 leading-tight">
          Qbits <span class="text-gradient">Solar Inverters</span> For India
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-brand-600 font-medium">
          On-grid and hybrid inverter families with model-specific monitoring options.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-6 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Qbits offers single-phase and three-phase on-grid inverters from 1.5 kW to 320 kW, plus single-phase and three-phase hybrid families from 3 kW to 12 kW. Electrical limits, communication interfaces, and supported accessories vary by model.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Current public datasheets list IP66 enclosures across the published families and maximum efficiencies from 97.6% to 99.02%, depending on model. Use the exact model datasheet when designing strings, selecting protection, or comparing output.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Public product material also describes remote monitoring and an expandable warranty. Ask for the current written monitoring, data-handling, service, and warranty terms for the exact model before purchase.
        </p>

        <!-- Highlight stats -->
        <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          {highlights.map((item) => (
            <div class="text-center p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
              <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600">{item.value}</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-medium">{item.label}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Left: C&I rooftop installation (sticks while the copy scrolls past) -->
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-1 relative lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start">
        <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-slate-100">
          <img
            src="/about/qbits-inverters-rooftop-installation.webp"
            alt="A technician reviewing system performance on a tablet beside a row of five wall-mounted Qbits solar inverters at a commercial rooftop installation"
            width="1254"
            height="1254"
            class="w-full h-auto block"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-brand-500/5 rounded-[2rem] blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
